{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6089aa9dc5a833d9665","chatId":"df363432e0f84b6cadb01785edb2fe42","sessionId":null,"userId":99064,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1091,"promptTokens":422,"completionTokens":120,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:42:00"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068938729069998,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6089aa9dc5a833d9664","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483720860,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:42:00","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6089aa9dc5a833d9664","chatId":"df363432e0f84b6cadb01785edb2fe42","sessionId":null,"userId":99064,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n安德烈是一名医生。由于过去几个月里经常发生紧急情况，他没有时间陪伴他的女友。所以，这个周末，他决定带他的女友去享受一个浪漫的约会之夜。正在快吃完主菜时，他接到医院的朋友的电话，告诉他好好享受这个夜晚。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，安德烈最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 惊喜\nB) 尴尬\nC) 紧张\nD) 失望\nE) 愧疚\nF) 自豪\n\n## 问题 2\n安德烈为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他突然接到朋友的电话，让他好好享受这个夜晚\nB) 他的老板允许他休息一天\nC) 安德烈已经能够处理他的医院紧急情况\nD) 他想和他的女朋友结婚","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068938729069998,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6089aa9dc5a833d9665","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483720857,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:42:00","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"e10c106ca7e54f5283f51cd4ada88171"}